{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A powerful aurora has swept across the entire globe.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are a sailor aboard the modern submarine Ares, operating in the waters of the Atlantic Ocean.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Not by your own choice, you have found yourself at the epicenter of these events.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/extras/01add50ed87107837881cc588fb94dce.poster.avif?t=1761567968\" width=800 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/extras/01add50ed87107837881cc588fb94dce.webm?t=1761567968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/extras/01add50ed87107837881cc588fb94dce.mp4?t=1761567968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Submarine is a new entry in the Static Dread universe. It takes place in a strange near-future world where a catastrophic aurora has erased much of modern civilization\u2019s achievements, forcing humanity to face unfamiliar threats and impossible choices. Deep beneath a northern sea, you and your crew fight isolation, failing systems, and something far older than any map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide the Ares through black water, piece together what the aurora awakened, and decide how much of your crew\u2014and yourself\u2014you\u2019re willing to sacrifice to see the next dawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/extras/2eb33a4cddb898392a9d456081e19cfd.poster.avif?t=1761567968\" width=800 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/extras/2eb33a4cddb898392a9d456081e19cfd.webm?t=1761567968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/extras/2eb33a4cddb898392a9d456081e19cfd.mp4?t=1761567968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lovecraftian dread in a claustrophobic submarine setting</strong><br>Feel the pressure build\u2014steel bulkheads, narrow corridors, and the crushing weight of the ocean above you. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices that reshape gameplay and your crew</strong><br>Every decision has consequences. When a crewmate dies or breaks, their duties don\u2019t disappear\u2014you\u2019ll have to assume their role, reroute procedures, and keep the Ares operational with fewer hands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique sonar exploration mechanic</strong><br>Active and passive scans reveal wrecks, trenches, and things that answer back. Decode strange echoes to uncover secrets buried on the seafloor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching paths and multiple endings</strong><br>Your route, your priorities, and your acts under pressure determine how the story concludes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/extras/878ad159e638f61946b44ad592fc98d8.avif?t=1761567968\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/extras_big/878ad159e638f61946b44ad592fc98d8.webp?t=1761567968 width=1560 height=439 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take a breath. Check your bearings. Prepare to submerge and try to save your crew.</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4042160?t=1761567968","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/fd610284da201db2ecb94ba8bf3ddbb588b10914/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761567968","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/f97a0d6742e81fd7db345554d44fba60ed24a745/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761567968","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/f97a0d6742e81fd7db345554d44fba60ed24a745/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761567968","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A powerful aurora has swept across the entire globe.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are a sailor aboard the modern submarine Ares, operating in the waters of the Atlantic Ocean.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Not by your own choice, you have found yourself at the epicenter of these events.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/extras/01add50ed87107837881cc588fb94dce.poster.avif?t=1761567968\" width=800 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/extras/01add50ed87107837881cc588fb94dce.webm?t=1761567968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/extras/01add50ed87107837881cc588fb94dce.mp4?t=1761567968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Submarine is a new entry in the Static Dread universe. It takes place in a strange near-future world where a catastrophic aurora has erased much of modern civilization\u2019s achievements, forcing humanity to face unfamiliar threats and impossible choices. Deep beneath a northern sea, you and your crew fight isolation, failing systems, and something far older than any map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide the Ares through black water, piece together what the aurora awakened, and decide how much of your crew\u2014and yourself\u2014you\u2019re willing to sacrifice to see the next dawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/extras/2eb33a4cddb898392a9d456081e19cfd.poster.avif?t=1761567968\" width=800 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/extras/2eb33a4cddb898392a9d456081e19cfd.webm?t=1761567968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/extras/2eb33a4cddb898392a9d456081e19cfd.mp4?t=1761567968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lovecraftian dread in a claustrophobic submarine setting</strong><br>Feel the pressure build\u2014steel bulkheads, narrow corridors, and the crushing weight of the ocean above you. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices that reshape gameplay and your crew</strong><br>Every decision has consequences. When a crewmate dies or breaks, their duties don\u2019t disappear\u2014you\u2019ll have to assume their role, reroute procedures, and keep the Ares operational with fewer hands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique sonar exploration mechanic</strong><br>Active and passive scans reveal wrecks, trenches, and things that answer back. Decode strange echoes to uncover secrets buried on the seafloor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching paths and multiple endings</strong><br>Your route, your priorities, and your acts under pressure determine how the story concludes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/extras/878ad159e638f61946b44ad592fc98d8.avif?t=1761567968\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/extras_big/878ad159e638f61946b44ad592fc98d8.webp?t=1761567968 width=1560 height=439 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take a breath. Check your bearings. Prepare to submerge and try to save your crew.</h2>","developers":["solarsuit.games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/9b47d253f6584d509c78115fc636a7455e1018d4/header.jpg?t=1761567968","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4042160/341592697/f6ad3758176ba7ddc08a20a1fc6612b8b4a9e87c/1761171243/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761567946","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4042160/341592697/f6ad3758176ba7ddc08a20a1fc6612b8b4a9e87c/1761171243/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761567946","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4042160/341592697/f6ad3758176ba7ddc08a20a1fc6612b8b4a9e87c/1761171243/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761567946","id":257221299,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257221299/movie480.mp4?t=1761567946","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257221299/movie_max.mp4?t=1761567946"},"na